ng (nay l\'b5 Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1) quy \'ae\'denh chi ti\'d5t thi h\'b5nh Lu\'cbt thu\'d5 doanh thu, Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh s\'e8 22/H\'a7BT ng\'b5y 24/01/1991 c\'f1a H\'e9i \'ae\'e5ng B\'e9 tr\'ad\'ebng (nay l\'b5 Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1) quy \'ae\'denh ch\'d5 \'ae\'e9
 thu s\'f6 d\'f4ng v\'e8n NSNN; Th\'abng t\'ad s\'e8 45/TC/TCTng\'b5y 4/10/1990 c\'f1a B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n thi h\'b5nh Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh s\'e8 351/H\'a7BT; Th\'abng t\'ad s\'e8 89TC/TCT ng\'b5y 31/12/1992 c\'f1a B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'dd
nh h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n thi h\'b5nh Quy\'d5t \'ae\'denh s\'e8 110TTg c\'f1a Th\'f1 t\'ad\'edng Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 v\'d2 b\'e6 sung, s\'f6a \'ae\'e6i m\'e9t s\'e8 \'aei\'d3m trong ch\'d5 \'ae\'e9 thu s\'f6 d\'f4ng v\'e8n ng\'a9n s\'b8ch Nh\'b5 n\'ad\'edc;

\par \tab C\'a8n c\'f8 c\'abng v\'a8n s\'e8 1040KTTH ng\'b5y 18/3/1993 c\'f1a V\'a8n ph\'dfng CH\'ddnh ph\'f1 th\'abng b\'b8o quy\'d5t \'ae\'denh c\'f1a Th\'f1 t\'ad\'edng Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 cho x\'d0t gi\'b6m thu\'d5 doanh thu, thu\'d5 ti\'aau th\'f4 \'ae\'c6
c bi\'d6t n\'a8m 1991,1992 cho c\'b8c x\'dd nghi\'d6p g\'c6p kh\'e3 kh\'a8n v\'b5 c\'abng v\'a8n s\'e8 753TC/TCT ng\'b5y 30/4/1993 c\'f1a B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n vi\'d6c x\'d0t gi\'b6m thu\'d5 doanh thu v\'b5 thu\'d5 ti\'aau th\'f4 \'ae
